        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: रिवाज",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रिवाज — rivāj — \"a custom\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हमारे गाँव में त्योहार पर नए कपड़े पहनने का रिवाज है। hamāre gā̃v meṁ tyohār par nae kapṛe pahanne kā rivāj hai. In our village it is the custom to wear new clothes for a festival."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रिवाज (rivāj) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic rawāj, \"currency, being in use\": what is current in a place. का रिवाज है is it is the custom to."
            }
          ]
        },
